WEBVTT

00:09:58.812 --> 00:10:02.799
sida saxda ah sababtoo ah salakeeda waa siyaasad

00:10:02.799 --> 00:10:05.639
waxayna kadhigan taas in xalkeda lahli karo

00:10:05.639 --> 00:10:08.326
dhaxdhaxaadiska waxay noqon kartaa shaqo kafadhiisasho

00:10:08.326 --> 00:10:11.145
sikasta ay u adagtahy wili way noqonosa

00:10:11.145 --> 00:10:15.137
waxaas oo dhan waxay ahaayen yitzhak rabin waxoo nasfad ahantiisa dhahay

00:10:15.137 --> 00:10:18.123
"saaxiibada nabad lama sameysid

00:10:18.123 --> 00:10:20.503
waxaa lasameysaa nabad cadowgaaga.&amp;quot;

00:10:20.503 --> 00:10:21.938
Mahadsanid .

00:10:21.938 --> 00:10:27.020
(sacbis)